Package: caretS3
Type: Package
Title: A Minimal S3 Interface to 'caret' Models Without Resampling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Thierry", "Moudiki", email = "thierry.moudiki@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits any 'caret' model on a matrix/data frame of predictors and
    a response, with fixed hyperparameters (no cross-validation), and exposes
    the result through standard S3 methods: predict(), print(), coef().
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    caret,
    stats
Suggests:
    glmnet,
    randomForest,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
